---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact Linespedia | Get in Touch" 
  description="Contact Linespedia for feedback, suggestions, partnerships, or general inquiries. We'd love to hear from you."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-24 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif font-black mb-12 text-primary">Contact Linespedia</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-indigo max-w-none text-primary/80">
      <p>
        Thank you for your interest in Linespedia. We welcome feedback, suggestions, partnership inquiries, 
        and general questions from our community.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        For general inquiries, ideas, or to share your thoughts about Linespedia, please use the form below 
        or email us directly.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-indigo-50/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 border border-indigo-100/30 not-prose">
        <p class="text-primary/80 font-semibold mb-4">
          📧 <a href="https://tally.so/r/vG4Wv8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline font-bold">
            Contact Form & Newsletter
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-primary/60">
          Click the link above to access our contact form, subscribe to our newsletter, or share your ideas for Linespedia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Copyright or Content Concerns?</h2>
      <p>
        If you have copyright concerns, believe content violates your rights, or want to report 
        inappropriate content, please visit our <a href="/copyright/">Copyright & Report Content page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Follow Us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Join our community on <a href="https://t.me/memesx69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram</a></li>
        <li>Check out <a href="https://30tools.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">30tools.com</a> for related tools and resources</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Response Time</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to respond to all inquiries within 5-7 business days. During busy periods, 
        it may take slightly longer. We appreciate your patience.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>General questions about Linespedia and how to use our platform</li>
        <li>Feature requests and suggestions</li>
        <li>Partnership and collaboration opportunities</li>
        <li>Bug reports and technical issues</li>
        <li>Feedback on specific poems or collections</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What to Report on Our Copyright Page</h2>
      <p>
        For legal matters, please see the <a href="/copyright/">Copyright & Report Content page</a> for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Copyright infringement reports (DMCA)</li>
        <li>Content moderation requests</li>
        <li>Rights and attribution concerns</li>
        <li>Removal requests</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-12" />

      <p class="text-sm text-primary/60">
        Last updated: May 9, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
